            <div xml:id="d926">

                <pb facs="1085" n="990" xml:id="pg990"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.3362i/15: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-07-16T18:00:00-04:00">July 16, 1936—6 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>94. Your 153, July 13, 10 a.m. The Department would not wish to instruct you to
                    seek a further interview but authorizes you, in the event a favorable
                    opportunity should arise, to mention the matter again if such action seems
                    advisable to you.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
